tpm 1
boot power
# select-card-saved: port 1 holds card-save's card (a save file; SW_ON loads it at power-on),
# port 2 an unformatted card. Option mode (as select-option), then: Options, Load from port 1;
# Rankings, Load from port 1; Options, Save to port 1 (overwrite? Left to Yes, Cross);
# Rankings, Save to port 2: unformatted, format? Cross on No (back to the prompt); port 2 again,
# Left to Yes, Cross: formatted, then the file is created. Exit; Right, Cross, Cross: Puzzle Mode
# starts with the loaded options and rankings.
card 1 re/cards/egypt1-saved.mcd.gz
card 2 re/cards/unformatted.mcd.gz
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
100 1 START
program TITLE
100 1 START
program SELECT
70 2 LEFT
80 2 CROSS
110 2 CROSS
220 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 CROSS
+20 2 DOWN
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 CROSS
+20 2 UP
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 LEFT
+10 2 CROSS
+20 2 DOWN
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 LEFT
+10 2 CROSS
+30 2 DOWN
+10 2 CROSS
+90 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+30 2 CROSS
program PAZLE
end 60
